      "title": "First-down play-action",
      "recommendation": "On neutral downs, tilt the menu toward first-down play-action and quick-pass concepts instead of run-first habits. The goal is to stay ahead of the chains and create easier second downs and more explosives.",
      "rationale": "Public analytics consistently show that early-down passing is more efficient than the standard run-run-pass pattern; many teams still leave EPA on the table by protecting balance instead of winning yards.",
      "prior": {
